WEBVTT

00:00:29.412 --> 00:00:31.660
na što spadaju svi ostali problemi,

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.302
energija, struja, tok elektrona.

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:38.421
Odlučio sam pokušati

00:00:38.421 --> 00:00:41.803
riješiti taj problem.

00:00:41.803 --> 00:00:45.775
Ovo vjerojatno nije što očekujete.

00:00:45.775 --> 00:00:47.427
Vjerojatno očekujete da ovdje

00:00:47.427 --> 00:00:49.006
govorim o fuziji,

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:50.986
jer sam to radio većinu svog života.

00:00:50.986 --> 00:00:54.252
No ovo je zapravo govor o - u redu --

00:00:54.252 --> 00:00:56.876
(Smijeh) --

00:00:56.876 --> 00:00:59.843
no ovo je zapravo govor o fisiji.

00:00:59.843 --> 00:01:01.369
O usavršavanju nečega starog,